# Allowlist: the image is built from the workspace manifests and the app/package sources only.
# Anything else in the working tree (secrets, local data, scratch) never reaches the build.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/
!packages/

# Inside the allowed folders: no installs, builds, local data or env files.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.ehpk
